Fleet markers for build_static_bundle.sh / rpm %build.

Opt-in only (never commit *.force files):
  - stampede3.force — created by scripts/prepare_rpmbuild_stampede3.sh
  - ls6.force — created by scripts/prepare_rpmbuild_ls6.sh
  - horizon.force — created by scripts/prepare_rpmbuild_horizon.sh
    (enables --enable-shared-node-multi-jid; first shared-node fleet)

Embedded in the dist tarball via dist-hook when the file exists at make dist time.
Or set HPCS_BUNDLE_FLEET=stampede3|ls6|horizon for the prepare/build host.

When multiple markers exist, explicit HPCS_BUNDLE_FLEET wins. Prepare wrappers create
one marker at a time and export the matching fleet env.

Default prepare_rpmbuild_dirs.sh must not require or ship any force file.
